      },
      "message": "fix(3d): a whole-model 3D Pocket clears the stock out to its outline\n\nThe #1749 open-side band grew only from the silhouette, so stock reaching\nmore than about two tool radii past the model stayed standing while the\nop read ok. The band now grows from the stock's outline too (the 2D\npocket's #12 reading), for the 3D Pocket and Multi-Axis Rough alike; the\nsetup's other parts stay cut out of it.\n\nNeither kind carries a 3+2 index (OpParams::tilt is None for both), so\nthe issue's tilted case cannot be built; the open-side law's tilted\nbranch, which silently kept the old footprint, now refuses by name.\n\nFixes #1774\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
