      "message": "Merge main into issue/1774-pocket3d-open-far-tilted (pocket3d_open_side.rs: keep both sides)\n\nThe conflict in crates/app/tests/pocket3d_open_side.rs is two sets of\nadded tests at the same place: this PR's far-stock and no-tilt tests,\nand main's live-post refusal tests for parts added after generation.\nBoth are kept. shared_face_bodies.rs and the #1749 decision file merge\nwithout a conflict and equal main's version.\n\nRefs #1774\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus <noreply@anthropic.com>",
